# Semgrep ignore patterns for false positives
# This file excludes utility scripts and tools from certain Semgrep checks
# that produce false positives for URL validation and similar patterns.

# Fix scripts often contain URL patterns for validation/remediation
fix_*.py

# Tool scripts may contain URL manipulation for legitimate purposes
tools/**

# Utility scripts often work with URLs for validation or processing
scripts/**

# Note: This does not exclude these paths from all security scanning,
# only from Semgrep rules that may flag legitimate URL operations as suspicious.
# Critical security issues will still be caught by other tools (Bandit, Safety).
